.ds AD l
.TH "pocket_acq" "1" "" "" "Pocket SDR"
.SH NAME
pocket_acq \- GNSS signal acquisition from IF data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
pocket_acq [\-sig sig] [\-prn prn[,...]] [\-tint tint] [\-toff toff]
           [\-fmt {INT8|INT8X2|CS8|CS16}] [\-f freq] [\-fi freq]
           [\-d freq[,freq]] [\-nz]
           [\-w file] [\-v] file
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search GNSS signals in a digital IF data file and report acquisition results (Doppler, code offset, C/N0).
For each PRN, parallel\-code FFT search with non\-coherent integration is performed.
.PP
If a tag file \f[CR]<file>.tag\f[R] exists alongside the input, the IF format, sampling frequency, LO frequencies, and per\-CH sampling type are taken from the tag and the corresponding command\-line
options are ignored.
.SH OPTIONS ([]: DEFAULT)
.TP
\f[CR]\-sig sig\f[R]
GNSS signal type ID (\f[CR]L1CA\f[R], \f[CR]L2CM\f[R], \f[CR]L5I\f[R], \&...).
For supported IDs see \f[CR]doc/signal_IDs.pdf\f[R].
[\f[CR]L1CA\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-prn prn[,...]\f[R]
PRN numbers, comma\-separated.
A range like \f[CR]1\-32\f[R] is accepted.
For GLONASS FDMA signals (\f[CR]G1CA\f[R], \f[CR]G2CA\f[R]) this is the FCN.
[\f[CR]1\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-tint tint\f[R]
Coherent integration time in ms.
[code cycle]
.TP
\f[CR]\-toff toff\f[R]
Time offset from the start of the IF data in ms.
[\f[CR]0.0\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-fmt {INT8|INT8X2|CS8|CS16}\f[R]
IF data format.
\f[CR]INT8\f[R] is single\-channel real int8, \f[CR]INT8X2\f[R] is single\-channel interleaved int8 IQ, and \f[CR]CS8\f[R]/\f[CR]CS16\f[R] are SoapySDR complex int8/int16 formats.
Pocket SDR FE packed RAW formats are not expanded by \f[CR]pocket_acq\f[R]; dump channel\-separated files with \f[CR]pocket_dump\f[R] first.
[\f[CR]INT8X2\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-f freq\f[R]
Sampling frequency of the IF data in MHz.
[\f[CR]12.0\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-fi freq\f[R]
IF frequency in MHz.
\f[CR]0\f[R] means IQ (zero\-IF) sampling.
[\f[CR]0.0\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-d ref_dop[,max_dop]\f[R]
Reference and maximum Doppler frequency to search in Hz.
[\f[CR]0.0,5000.0\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-nz\f[R]
Disable zero\-padding for circular correlation.
[enabled]
.TP
\f[CR]\-w file\f[R]
FFTW wisdom file.
[\f[CR]../python/fftw_wisdom.txt\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-v\f[R]
Print version and exit.
.TP
\f[CR]file\f[R]
Input digital IF data file.
The format is a series of \f[CR]int8_t\f[R] (I\-sampling), interleaved \f[CR]int8_t\f[R] (IQ\-sampling), or SoapySDR complex samples for \f[CR]CS8\f[R]/\f[CR]CS16\f[R], unless overridden by the tag
file.
